      "writtenOn": "2023-11-16T16:45:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why add the extra indirection _only_ for AVX512? I think there might be merit to this if we did it universally, so that all these helpers lived in\n\n`#if defined(JUMPER_IS_xxxxxxx)`\n\nblock above. That\u0027s how we do in highp and it\u0027s slightly nicer. But right now AVX-512 is out-of-line, and every other platform is inline; it\u0027s strange that AVX-512 is done differently.\n\nThis isn\u0027t a big deal, but ideally we could move all the platform lowp helpers into the `#if defined(JUMPER...)` blocks above. (If you want to tackle this, do it in a separate earlier CL?)",
